    {
      "name": "Annulation reservation (remboursement Stripe)",
      "description": "POST /api/v1/reservations/:id/cancel — Annule une reservation confirmed ou pending avec remboursement Stripe et distribution automatique de la penalite.\n\nPolitique :\n- Remboursement integral si >= 60 min avant le service (pas de penalite).\n- Penalite 20% si < 60 min avant le service, distribuee entre plateforme (70%) et station (30%) via Stripe transfer reversal.\n\nDistribution de la penalite (ex. reservation €10) :\n- Client remboursé : €8\n- Plateforme garde : €1 (commission) + €1.40 (70% penalite) = €2.40\n- Station garde : €0.60 (30% penalite)\n\nConfig modifiable en DB (settings, type=admin) :\n- cancellation_free_window_minutes (defaut: 60)\n- cancellation_penalty_percent (defaut: 20)\n- cancellation_penalty_platform_rate (defaut: 70)\n- cancellation_penalty_station_rate (defaut: 30)\n\nPrerequis : reservation au statut confirmed ou pending, auth client.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Annuler reservation — sans penalite (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Remboursement integral, pas de penalite', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.penalty_amount).to.eql(0);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.is_late_cancellation).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.refunded_amount).to.be.above(0);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.entry.status).to.eql('cancelled');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservation_id}}/cancel",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "reservations",
                "{{reservation_id}}",
                "cancel"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Plans changed\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Annulation >= 60 min avant le service : remboursement integral, penalite = 0.\n\nPour tester sans penalite, assurez-vous que le creneau est dans plus de 60 minutes."
          }
        },
        {
